# Files rsconnect must not ship to shinyapps.io.
#
# Two reasons to be strict here. Size: the handbook and its screenshots are 23 MB
# of the repo's 24 MB and are useless at runtime. Dependencies: leaving
# HANDBOOK.Rmd in the bundle makes rsconnect resolve rmarkdown, knitr and their
# trees as app dependencies, which lengthens every build for a document the
# server never renders.

# Documentation and its assets
HANDBOOK.Rmd
HANDBOOK.html
HANDBOOK_files
docs
DESIGN-REVIEW.md
README.md

# Tooling — screenshot capture runs on a developer machine, not the server
tools
install_packages.R

# Tests
tests

# Repo furniture
.claude
.gitignore
.rscignore
LICENSE
